0\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yNraMq1w1iMQ7kNvwHk8Dv_&_nc_oc=AdoKY3h4azDUabdDoyYLLEwrN-G_R7zuyq5Gky3OPO_VGhrIFrkSQK-hjbGdUZAW7Mc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIUs6kMz5DL7YBbgf8F81zb3XjmH_bjnuj2fBW1Qv0fRg&oe=6AAA87D6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ZVPm1KCDHUQ7kNvwFDE4yg&_nc_oc=Adqvx1e6Nu8umLNAI277PxyjwPUN5TrWVoryClR7ND3vafWNV6G65_WWAYayFUWiCKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKW1gp9QdgiPDjcJW8kmIOAiPiK0nGTPL0GsLmzTEmF4g&oe=6AAA91AD"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p90fXc90SkEQ7kNvwHA9FTs&_nc_oc=AdrSS31Swa2CfcYZLPPq2ydauLNi4ETXEz4s0md0FBo-N1PzJeQx3nINUuOSdNIO_So&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKZFOvQ-UmHuZJr3GRKUq5RUAoQnRvMXr_V6bNhBe8aGw&oe=6AAA89ED"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_ca